## Migration Guide

1. Generate a fresh print and compare scaffold metadata and ui-platform.json.
2. Check the domain's V1 contract, Angular/package, target and public configuration requirements.
3. Copy only your complete apps/<app>/src/app/domains/<id> folders into the fresh print.
4. Keep the fresh platform, root wiring, public contracts and generated registry tooling.
5. Install compatible dependencies, run npm run build:prod, npm test and npm run test:architecture.

See [DomainPortability.md](DeveloperReference/DomainPortability.md) for precise compatibility and copy proof instructions. A pre-V1 feature requires a one-time conversion; copying old features or private platform imports is not supported.
